  "instance_name": "mapping_001",
  "label": "Nancy Pelosi is mapped as the source of the hateful rhetoric attributed to Democrats",
  "description": "The visual of Nancy Pelosi, depicted speaking and gesturing authoritatively in a formal political setting, is juxtaposed with text that falsely attributes hateful and racist rhetoric to Democratic politicians. The meme uses her image to imply she is the originator or representative of this alleged hatred, creating an analogical mapping where the visual entity (Nancy Pelosi) is mapped onto the textual claim (the hateful rhetoric). This is a false attribution designed to delegitimize the Democratic Party and its members by associating them with the visual of a powerful political figure who is then falsely portrayed as their source.",
